# Explore the Algebraic Staircase

Begin with the central question: can ideals grow strictly forever? The [ascending chain condition](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Noetherian_ring) says no; its failure says yes. The characterization theorem turns this into a complete decision principle.

