## Build a staircase coordinate by coordinate

In the integer-sequence ring, rung $S_n$ contains exactly the sequences that vanish from coordinate $n$ onward. Moving to $S_{n+1}$ frees one new coordinate, and the unit vector $e_n$ proves strictness.

